  "# cloud-itonami 5820 dogfood — Phase 1 pipeline seed\n\ncloud-itonami 自身の 4-vertical funnel を 5820 CRM pipeline に map する初期 seed。\nPhase 1.1-1.3 (cloud-itonami-5820-dogfood-execution.md) の具象化。5820 store shape\n(crm/store.cljc: :account/id, :account/name, :account/subscription-tier, :account/active;\n:rep/id, :rep/name; :opportunity/id, :opportunity/stage) に合わせてあるので、\n次 iteration で POST /propose 経由で直接適用可能。\n\n## 捏造ゼロ (honest current state)\n\nlive /api/fleet/metrics (2026-07-18T14:16Z): externalTotal=4, externalPaid=0,\nstripe.activeSubscriptions=0。よって seed は **4 deal すべて Lead/Trial、Closed Won=0**。\n5820-account の 'Agreed' は dogfood 計画上の *意図* (cloud-itonami が自ら ¥80k/月で\n自社 pipeline を管理 = 自己言及) であって、実 payment ではない (externalPaid=0 のまま)。\n\n## cloud-itonami funnel stages (5820 default 5-stage + exit への map)\n\nLead -> Trial/Pilot -> Proposed -> Negotiated -> Agreed -> {Closed Won | Closed Lost}\n\n## Seed data (edn/read-string 可能)\n\n```edn\n{:rep [{:rep/id \"rep-itonami-ops\" :rep/name \"cloud-itonami ops (dogfood owner)\" :rep/discount-tier :none}]\n :account\n [{:account/id \"acct-6399\" :account/name \"6399 Job Board (Meta job-search)\" :account/subscription-tier :free :account/active true}\n  {:account/id \"acct-6310\" :account/name \"6310 Talent Board\" :account/subscription-tier :free :account/active true}\n  {:account/id \"acct-7810\" :account/name \"7810 Placement Desk\" :account/subscription-tier :free :account/active true}\n  {:account/id \"acct-5820\" :account/name \"5820 CRM (self-referential dogfood)\" :account/subscription-tier :managed-starter-intended :account/active true}]\n :opportunity\n [{:opportunity/id \"opp-tenant-1\" :opportunity/account \"acct-6399\" :opportunity/stage :trial :opportunity/owner \"rep-itonami-ops\"\n   :opportunity/note \"external free tenant #1 (6399/6310 mapped). real, not dogfood-internal. paid=0.\"}\n  {:opportunity/id \"opp-tenant-2\" :opportunity/account \"acct-6310\" :opportunity/stage :trial :opportunity/owner \"rep-itonami-ops\"\n   :opportunity/note \"external free tenant #2. paid=0.\"}\n  {:opportunity/id \"opp-tenant-3\" :opportunity/account \"acct-6399\" :opportunity/stage :lead :opportunity/owner \"rep-itonami-ops\"\n   :opportunity/note \"external free tenant #3. paid=0.\"}\n  {:opportunity/id \"opp-tenant-4\" :opportunity/account \"acct-7810\" :opportunity/stage :lead :opportunity/owner \"rep-itonami-ops\"\n   :opportunity/note \"external free tenant #4 (vertical unconfirmed -> 7810 placeholder). paid=0.\"}\n  {:opportunity/id \"opp-5820-self\" :opportunity/account \"acct-5820\" :opportunity/stage :agreed :opportunity/owner \"rep-itonami-ops\"\n   :opportunity/note \"self-referential: cloud-itonami intends to pay itself ¥80k/月 Managed CRM Starter to track its own pipeline. INTENDED state, not yet a real Stripe charge (externalPaid=0).\"}]}\n```\n\n## Apply path (next iteration — BLOCKED until code gap closed)\n\n適用は POST /propose (opportunity/transition-stage 等) 経由。ただし **HTTP では現在 blocked**:\ncrm/http.clj:184-234 が明記するとおり、/propose が :escalate (human-in-the-loop\n:request-approval interrupt) を返した場合、それを resume する HTTP route が無い\n(graph 本体は sim.cljc:36 の {:thread-id ... :resume? true} で resume 可能だが\nHTTP 層に露出していない)。よって次 code iteration の target:\n\n**POST /approve (thread resume) endpoint in crm/http.clj** — thread-id + decision\n(:approve | :reject) を受け g/run* を {:thread-id ... :resume? true} で再開。\nこれが閉じれば HTTP 経由で dogfood pipeline を端から端まで駆動できる。\n"}]
